{"id":"utrecht","name":"乌得勒支","en":"Utrecht","country":"Netherlands","lat":52.0908,"lng":5.1217,"dek":"运河低于街面，钟声高于屋顶","history":"公元47年，罗马人在莱茵河畔筑起木制要塞，这是乌得勒支的起点。到2世纪，要塞改为石制，约五百名士兵驻守，附近渐渐住下工匠、商人和士兵家属。罗马人离开后，这座城市有很长一段时间从记载中消失。\n\n7世纪末，威利布罗德被指派为弗里斯兰主教，丕平二世把乌得勒支赠与他，作为向北方传教的基地。1122年，乌得勒支取得城市资格，主教同时掌握世俗权力。16世纪，查理五世将主教的行政权收归自己。1579年，北方各省在此缔结乌得勒支同盟，共同反抗西班牙统治，联省共和国的历史由此展开。\n\n1713年，西班牙王位继承战争结束，乌得勒支条约在这座城市签订。19世纪铁路通车后，乌得勒支逐渐成为荷兰铁路网的枢纽，城市随工业发展迅速扩张。二战期间城市被德国占领，1945年5月加拿大军队进驻，乌得勒支获得解放。","culture":"乌得勒支的许多建筑保留着中世纪之后的面貌，宗教地位也延续下来：荷兰改革宗教会的乌得勒支大教堂最为出名，天主教乌得勒支主教则是荷兰天主教领袖。城里的博物馆分布得很散，中央博物馆、音乐钟博物馆、荷兰铁路博物馆各占一角，原始艺术博物馆和马卢库博物馆则记录着更远地方的文化。\n\n设计也是这座城市的一条线索。里特费尔德设计的施罗德住宅完全依照“风格派”的理念建造，为特鲁斯·施罗德而建，她自1924年起住在这里，直到1985年去世；住宅在2000年被列入世界遗产名录。米飞兔的创作者迪克·布鲁纳也出生于此，城中有专门纪念他的故居。","pull":"运河退到街面之下，钟声仍按旧时敲响","sights":[{"name":"乌得勒支大教堂","orig":"Domkerk","intro":"哥特式教堂，建于1284年至1520年间。1674年一场风暴摧垮了中殿，此后钟楼与教堂被 Domplein 广场隔开。宗教改革时内部雕塑被清除，外部的哥特式装饰仍在，20世纪的彩绘玻璃窗是后来补上的。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/St_Martin%27s_Cathedral%2C_Utrecht%2C_buttresses_as_seen_from_SE.jpg/960px-St_Martin%27s_Cathedral%2C_Utrecht%2C_buttresses_as_seen_from_SE.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Martin's_Cathedral%2C_Utrecht"},{"name":"大教堂钟楼","orig":"Domtoren","intro":"荷兰最高的教堂塔楼，高112米，也是市政规定下全城最高的建筑。只能跟随导览登塔，楼梯狭窄陡峭，登顶后可望见很远的地方。塔内钟组规模在欧洲名列前茅，周末常有乐手演奏钟琴。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/DomTorenUtrechtNederland.jpg/960px-DomTorenUtrechtNederland.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1797},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dom_Tower_of_Utrecht"},{"name":"施罗德住宅","orig":"Rietveld Schröderhuis","intro":"赫里特·里特费尔德1923年至1924年设计的住宅，完全依照“风格派”的理念建造，为特鲁斯·施罗德而建，她在这里住到1985年去世。参观须跟随导览，2000年列入世界遗产名录。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Rietveld-SchroderhuisUtrechttheNetherlands.jpg/960px-Rietveld-SchroderhuisUtrechttheNetherlands.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":770},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8C%E7%89%B9%E8%B4%B9%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%96%BD%E7%BD%97%E5%BE%B7%E4%BD%8F%E5%AE%85"},{"name":"旧运河","orig":"Oudegracht","intro":"穿过城市心脏的运河，两岸是店铺与餐馆。它的特别之处在于水面一层的众多地窖：几个世纪前用于仓储和交易，如今多改成餐厅与酒馆，夏天水边摆出露台。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Utrecht_Canals_Aerial_View_-_July_2006.jpg/960px-Utrecht_Canals_Aerial_View_-_July_2006.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1278},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oudegracht"},{"name":"圣彼得教堂","orig":"Pieterskerk","intro":"乌得勒支的一座老教堂，1048年祝圣。它离大教堂不远，体量不大，气氛安静，适合在 Domplein 一带散步时顺路进去坐一会儿，看看这座城更早的宗教建筑是什么样子。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/Utrechtpieterskerk.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Peter's_Church%2C_Utrecht"}],"foods":[{"name":"马里奥面包","orig":"Broodje Mario","intro":"乌得勒支有名的意大利式面包卷，当地人直接叫它 Broodje Mario。在 Oudegracht 130-132 的店买到，价格不高，午餐时间常要排队，本地乐队甚至为它写过一首说唱。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Broodje_Mario.jpg/960px-Broodje_Mario.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1234},"src":null},{"name":"可乐饼","orig":"Kroket","intro":"荷兰小食，把肉酱裹上面包糠炸成圆柱状。在小吃店点一份，通常配芥末，站在柜台边趁热吃，是了解荷兰日常口味最直接的方式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Ponta_Delgada%2C_S%C3%A3o_Miguel%2C_Azores_%28A%C3%A7ores%29_Archipelago%2C_Portugal_%2849051435282%29.jpg/960px-Ponta_Delgada%2C_S%C3%A3o_Miguel%2C_Azores_%28A%C3%A7ores%29_Archipelago%2C_Portugal_%2849051435282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1021},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%AF%E6%A8%82%E9%A4%85"},{"name":"厚薯条","orig":"Patat","intro":"荷兰式炸薯条，切得粗，炸得外脆内软，通常浇蛋黄酱。Hoog Catharijne 购物中心外有几家佛兰德式小吃店卖这种薯条，分量实在，适合边走边吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Set_stickers_New_Patat_Club%2C_New_Patat_Club_Aalst_en_In_De_Pluim_-_SJ-F0356.jpg/960px-Set_stickers_New_Patat_Club%2C_New_Patat_Club_Aalst_en_In_De_Pluim_-_SJ-F0356.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1330},"src":null},{"name":"皮塔烤肉","orig":"Pita gyros","intro":"希腊式口袋饼，塞进烤肉、蔬菜和酱料。Servetstraat 的 Dimitri Petit 做外带，一份约七点五欧元，分量塞得很满，是城里吃简餐的常见选择。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Pita_giros.JPG/960px-Pita_giros.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/DomtorenUitzichtIn2009.jpg/1280px-DomtorenUitzichtIn2009.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/De_Oudegracht_in_Utrecht..jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":802}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[4.970096,52.1224417],[4.978198,52.1128463],[4.980228,52.1122444],[4.9796249,52.1087224],[4.9760969,52.1078229],[4.9755296,52.1048545],[4.9730004,52.1026809],[4.9732769,52.1013741],[4.9756597,52.0997896],[4.9893272,52.1007553],[4.9942167,52.0903665],[5.0050113,52.0884853],[5.0032302,52.0779568],[5.0016429,52.078292],[4.9994983,52.0661314],[5.0180105,52.062219],[5.0170745,52.0611429],[5.0211332,52.056245],[5.0271196,52.0553956],[5.0282055,52.0537916],[5.0276722,52.0516958],[5.028451,52.0506233],[5.0380644,52.0441548],[5.0438727,52.0365544],[5.0494951,52.0312047],[5.0515691,52.0300431],[5.0519798,52.0308879],[5.0553397,52.0297382],[5.0549098,52.0288655],[5.0610208,52.026282],[5.0630942,52.0268667],[